 "readme": "# Synthetic Healthcare Data Generation using CTGAN and TVAE\n\n## Project Overview\n\nThis project generates realistic synthetic healthcare data using advanced generative models while preserving statistical fidelity and reducing privacy risks.\n\nThe project compares:\n- CTGAN (Conditional Tabular GAN)\n- TVAE (Tabular Variational Autoencoder)\n\nThe generated synthetic data preserves:\n- numerical distributions\n- categorical distributions\n- feature correlations\n- healthcare expense patterns\n- geographic patterns\n\nThe project also includes:\n- fidelity evaluation\n- privacy evaluation\n- MLflow experiment tracking\n- Streamlit deployment\n\n---\n\n## Features\n\n- CTGAN implementation\n- TVAE implementation\n- Synthetic healthcare data generation\n- Numerical fidelity evaluation\n- Categorical fidelity evaluation\n- KS Test evaluation\n- Jensen-Shannon Divergence\n- Correlation preservation\n- Privacy evaluation\n- MLflow experiment tracking\n- Streamlit dashboard deployment\n\n---\n\n## Dataset\n\nDataset Used:\n- Synthea Synthetic Patient Dataset\n\nDataset includes:\n- demographic information\n- healthcare expenses\n- healthcare coverage\n- geographic information\n- patient survival information\n\n---\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Python\n- SDV\n- PyTorch\n- MLflow\n- Scikit-learn\n- Pandas\n- NumPy\n- Matplotlib\n- Seaborn\n- Streamlit\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```text\nproject/\n│\n├── data/\n│   └── patients.csv\n│\n├── outputs/\n│   ├── ctgan_model.pkl\n│   ├── tvae_model.pkl\n│   ├── synthetic_ctgan.csv\n│   ├── synthetic_tvae.csv\n│   ├── evaluation_results.json\n│   ├── privacy_results.json\n│   └── plots/\n│\n├── src/\n│   ├── preprocess.py\n│   ├── train.py\n│   ├── generator.py\n│   ├── evaluation.py\n│   └── privacy.py\n│\n├── app.py\n├── main.py\n├── requirements.txt\n├── README.md\n└── .gitignore",
